h Allah, (untuk semua perkara) diputuskan dengan adil. Dan ketika itu rugilah orang-orang yang berpegang kepada yang batil.","enText":"And We have already sent messengers before you. Among them are those [whose stories] We have related to you, and among them are those [whose stories] We have not related to you. And it was not for any messenger to bring a sign [or verse] except by permission of Allah. So when the command of Allah comes, it will be concluded in truth, and the falsifiers will thereupon lose [all].","readText":"wa laqad arsaln\u0101 rusulam ming qablika min-hum mang qa\u1e63a\u1e63n\u0101 'alaika wa min-hum mal lam naq\u1e63u\u1e63 'ala\u012bk, wa m\u0101 k\u0101na liras\u1ee5lin ay ya`tiya bi`\u0101yatin ill\u0101 bi`i\u017cnill\u0101h, fa i\u017c\u0101 j\u0101`a amrull\u0101hi qu\u1e0diya bil-\u1e25aqqi wa khasira hun\u0101likal-mub\u1e6dil\u1ee5n","audio":"https:\/\/everyayah.com\/data\/Alafasy_64kbps\/040078.mp3","juz":24,"manzil":6,"page":476,"ruku":411,"hizbQuarter":190,"sajda":false},{"verseId":79,"ayahText":"\u0627\u064e\u0644\u0644\u0651\u0670\u0647\u064f \u0627\u0644\u0651\u064e\u0630\u0650\u064a\u0652 \u062c\u064e\u0639\u064e\u0644\u064e \u0644\u064e\u0643\u064f\u0645\u064f \u0627\u0644\u0652\u0627\u064e\u0646\u0652\u0639\u064e\u0627\u0645\u064e \u0644\u0650\u062a\u064e\u0631\u0652\u0643\u064e\u0628\u064f\u0648\u0652\u0627 \u0645\u0650\u0646\u0652\u0647\u064e\u0627 \u0648\u064e\u0645\u0650\u0646\u0652\u0647\u064e\u0627 \u062a\u064e\u0623\u0652\u0643\u064f\u0644\u064f\u0648\u0652\u0646\u064e\u06d6","indoText":"Allah-lah yang menjadikan hewan ternak untukmu, sebagian untuk kamu kendarai dan sebagian lagi kamu makan.","enText":"It is Allah who made for you the grazing animals upon which you ride, and some of them you eat.","readText":"all\u0101hulla\u017c\u012b ja'ala lakumul-an'\u0101ma litarkab\u1ee5 min-h\u0101 wa min-h\u0101 ta`kul\u1ee5n","audio":"https:\/\/everyayah.com\/data\/Alafasy_64kbps\/040079.mp3","juz":24,"manzil":6,"page":476,"ruk